00:013:26.000 --> 00:013:34.000
Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem. So, this Sura contains two of them, two of the opening

00:013:34.000 --> 00:013:40.000
statement or Basmalahs, one at the beginning and one in verse 30.

00:013:40.000 --> 00:013:47.000
And this restores the number of this important opening statement to 114

00:013:47.000 --> 00:013:57.000
or 19 times 6. Also, if you count the Suras from the

00:013:57.000 --> 00:014:06.000
