00:016:29.000 --> 00:016:37.000
Bismillah, from Sura 9 to Sura 27, we find exactly 19 Suras, inclusive.

00:016:37.000 --> 00:016:48.000
This is the Sura that has two Bismillahs and it is Sura number 19 after the missing

00:016:48.000 --> 00:016:55.000
Bismillah of Sura 9. From the missing Bismillah in Sura 9 to the extra

00:016:55.000 --> 00:017:03.000
Bismillah in Sura 27, there are 19 Suras.

00:017:03.000 --> 00:017:09.000
So, when you count the Suras from the missing Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem of

00:017:09.000 --> 00:017:17.000
Sura 9 to the extra Bismillah in Sura 27, you find 19 Suras. Now, watch this:

00:017:17.000 --> 00:017:23.000
if you add the numbers of the Suras, the numbers assigned to the Suras, from 9

00:017:23.000 --> 00:017:28.000
to 27, from the missing Bismillah to the extra Bismillah, that is 9 plus 10

00:017:28.000 --> 00:017:34.000
